                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On September 11, 1950, Secretary of State Acheson discussed the world situation
                    in executive session before the Senate Foreign Relations Committee; for the
                    record of his testimony, see <hi rendition="#italic">Reviews of the <pb
                            facs="0414" n="398" xml:id="pg398"/> World Situation, 1949–1950:
                        Hearings Held in Executive Session Before the Committee on Foreign
                        Relations, United States Senate</hi> (81st Cong., 1st and 2nd sessions),
                    pages 339–366.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
